# Higgsfield MCP

The only Higgsfield server in this repo is `motion-kit-higgsfield` in `.cursor/mcp.json` (`https://mcp.higgsfield.ai/mcp`). In the agent tool list it appears as `project-0-motion-site-kit-motion-kit-higgsfield`.

- Call Higgsfield tools only on that namespace.
- Do not use `plugin-higgsfield-higgsfield`.
- Do not add Higgsfield to `~/.cursor/mcp.json`.
- If the project connector is unauthorized, ask to reconnect it. Do not fall back to the marketplace plugin.
